  message: "Verified Tauri v2 IPC linker on readest (56 IPC edges) and yaak (67 IPC edges). Plugin invoke syntax (invoke('plugin:name|command')) works correctly. No gaps found — the linker handles invoke(), TAURI_INVOKE(), #[tauri::command], event emit/listen, and specta wrapper resolution. New linkers also validated: crypto-flow (79 edges in yaak), message dispatch (268+767 edges), CRDT (560+19 edges)."  # f0c1
