  message: "Ran formal DEEP bakeoff (session deep-20260318-005759) on all 4 Tauri v2 repos + podman-desktop.\n\nResults — all GOOD:\n| Repo | Total Edges | ipc_calls | ipc_event | crypto_flow | crdt_publishes | message_dispatch |\n|------|-------------|-----------|-----------|-------------|----------------|------------------|\n| Cap | 35,549 | 111 | 0 | 1 | 400 | 2,269 |\n| readest | 18,208 | 46 | 8 | 0 | 560 | 268 |\n| yaak | 16,789 | 57 | 6 | 79 | 19 | 767 |\n| spacedrive | 32,194 | 32 | 13 | 439 | 7 | 225 |\n| podman-desktop | 50,807 | 0 (Electron) | 0 | 0 | 750 | 6,543 |\n\npodman-desktop uses bridge_invokes (67 edges) via contextBridge instead of Tauri IPC.\n\nThe Tauri v2 linker covers: invoke(), TAURI_INVOKE(), #[tauri::command], plugin:name|command syntax, event emit/listen, and specta wrapper resolution. No gaps found."  # f19f
